<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Each VFX has its own row in the 2DA file. Each VFX is divided into 3 parts: impact, duration, and cessation. Each part will have its own slot in that VFX's row. Each slot is an entry for an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/FMOD" title="FMOD">FMOD</a> event that will be the designated sound for that part of that VFX.
</p>
